                                            {
                                                "example_id": "901894c8-d0a1-4053-9962-d64abd821a02",
                                                "sense_id": "e7966631-9250-3311-b63c-6154ad30c63a",
                                                "text": "As Barclay Capital's Douglas Anmuth wrote in a report on Friday morning, Google's \"core search growth\" is slowing, so there may now be a \"greater urgency in pursuing specific verticals\". So, what other specialised areas could Google target?"
